sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Encoder as plantuml-encoder
    participant Server as PlantUML Server
    participant Settings as Vista Settings

    Browser->>Settings: Read plantuml_server_url
    Note over Settings: Default: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml

    Browser->>Browser: Load .puml raw source from arch API
    Browser->>Encoder: Encode diagram source to URL-safe string
    Encoder-->>Browser: Encoded string

    Browser->>Browser: Construct URL: {server}/svg/{encoded}
    Browser->>Server: GET {server}/svg/{encoded}

    alt Server unreachable / timeout
        Server-->>Browser: Network error
        Note over Browser: Show error message +<br/>raw .puml source as fallback
    else Invalid PlantUML syntax
        Server-->>Browser: Error SVG with syntax message
        Note over Browser: Display error SVG inline
    else Success
        Server-->>Browser: SVG content
        Note over Browser: Render SVG inline in diagram card
    end
